1. Status of this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is published publicly on GitHub. Nothing in it is confidential,
and nothing in it may be treated as a trade secret of Exasol AG. Material that
must stay confidential does not belong here: it belongs in a private or
internal repository, and committing it here would publish it.

Publication is not a grant of rights. Making source visible and granting
permission to use it are separate acts, and only the second one is a licence.
Exasol AG performs the first and withholds the second.

