-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Ownership carve-outs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ownership in this repository is path-scoped:

- Exasol AG owns the pilot platform material by default: automation, dashboard
  and chatbot code, scheduler and operations code, runbooks, the migration
  framework and the non-semantic-layer SQL and analytics implementation.

- Where a pilot adopts a licensed third-party semantic layer, that vendor's
  materials remain the property of <SEMANTIC_LAYER_VENDOR> under separate terms.
  Exasol ownership claims do not apply to vendor-origin material.

- Customer-origin material remains the property of the respective customer.
  In this public template repository, `clients/` contains a placeholder and no
  customer material. None may be added here.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Repositories generated from this template
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This file is copied into every repository generated from this template. A
generated pilot repository is a different thing from this one: it is normally
private, and it does carry customer-origin material under `clients/`.

In a generated repository, sections 1 and 3 do not apply, the confidentiality
and access terms in ACCESS.md do apply, and customer material is
customer-confidential as described in NOTICE and COPYRIGHT.md. Sections 2, 4
and 5 apply unchanged in both cases.

